{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02740","headline":"咏画障 · 上官仪","name":"咏画障","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"芳晨丽日桃花浦，珠帘翠帐凤凰楼。\n蔡女菱歌移锦缆，燕姬春望上琼钩。\n新妆漏影浮轻扇，冶袖飘香入浅流。\n未减行雨荆台下，自比凌波洛浦游。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"上官仪","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02740.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02740","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}